<text corresp="#AC" xml:lang="sa"><body>
  <pb n="638" facs="686"/>
  <p>
    <lb n="1"/>cintā॰―uktam evārthaṃ dṛṣṭāntāntareṇāpy upapādayati—yo bālam ity ādinā | yo bālaṃ hanti yas tu <lb n="2"/>striyaṃ hanti yaś ca vā śaraṇāgataṃ hanti <hi rend="bold">yaś ca kṛtaghnaḥ prāyaścittair viśuddhān a</hi>pi tān etān <hi rend="bold">sādhusaṃsṛṣṭya<lb n="3"/>narhāñ jagaduḥ</hi> | smaryate hi―
  </p>
  <lg corresp="#VP65.14 #Is4.17">
    <l><lb n="4"/>‘śāstreṣu niṣkṛtir dṛṣṭā mahāpātakinām api</l>
    <l><lb n="5"/>śaraṇāgatahantus tu na dṛṣṭā niṣkṛtiḥ kvacit ||’</l>
  </lg>
    <p>
      iti |
    </p>
    <p>
    <lb n="6"/>tathā ‘kṛtaghne nāsti niṣkṛtiḥ’ iti | evaṃ bālastrīnidhananindāvacanāni pāṭhyani | itthaṃ <lb n="7"/>vacanabalāl loke ca tādṛśām utpathavṛtīnām adhyātmavidbhir aparigrahāc ca sūtrakārair darśitam| kim artham idaṃ śāstram etā<lb n="8"/>dṛśaṃ niṣkṛtyabhāvapratipādakaṃ niṣṭhuravacanaṃ vaktīty āśaṅkyāha―śāstram iti |  <hi rend="bold">yadi śāstraṃ śāsanīyaṃ bhavati</hi> <lb n="9"/>tarhi pāpapravaṇeṣu śāstrasya pāratantryaṃ syād eva tathā ca sampluto dharmasetur iti | kṛtyākṛtyaniyamābhāvas syā<lb n="10"/>d iti kṛtaṃ vistareṇa || 415 ||
    </p>
    
</body></text></TEI>
